WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Work and power. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Distinguish energy transfer from its rate

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Work measures energy transferred along displacement; power measures how quickly that transfer occurs.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: 100 N aligned over 20 m gives 2,000 J; completing it in 10 s means 200 W average power.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Unit check

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Distinguish energy transfer from its rate
